{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109491","id":2733571809,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6i7v7h","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109491","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109491.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109491.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109491","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109491/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109491/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109491/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/459cb33abc754a69ffdbc93ba334240b4b0b6e65","number":109491,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Android: Add method to set root window color at runtime","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- This PR adds a method to set the root window background color at runtime.\r\n- The second commit uses this method to make the Android editor’s root window color match the editor background color.\r\n---\r\n\r\nWhat I mean by \"root window\" here?\r\n\r\nThe root window is the one on which the Godot app is rendered. It’s only visible in areas where Godot  doesn’t render, the status bar, navigation bar, and display cutouts.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108557 added an export option to set this background color at export time. However, there are valid reasons to want to change it at runtime. For example, I want to change it dynamically based on the app’s theme color.\r\n\r\n~Currently, it’s already possible to change this color at runtime using `JavaClassWrapper` and `AndroidRuntime`. Since I was already adding a method to change it for the Editor, I figured it made sense to expose it as well. That’s the only reason.~\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Example to set it via JavaClassWrapper</summary>\r\n\r\n```\r\nfunc set_system_bar_color(color: Color, override_appearance := false) -> void:\r\n\tif not android_runtime:\r\n\t\treturn\r\n\t\r\n\tvar activity = android_runtime.getActivity()\r\n\tvar callable = func ():\r\n\t\tvar window = activity.getWindow()\r\n\t\tvar decorView = window.getDecorView()\r\n\t\tdecorView.setBackgroundColor(color.to_argb32())\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\tif (is_light_system_bars != (color.get_luminance() > 0.45)) or override_appearance:\r\n\t\t\tis_light_system_bars = color.get_luminance() > 0.45\r\n\t\t\tvar WindowInsetsControllerCompat = JavaClassWrapper.wrap(\"androidx.core.view.WindowInsetsControllerCompat\")\r\n\t\t\tvar controller = WindowInsetsControllerCompat.call(\"<init>\", window, window.getDecorView())\r\n\t\t\tcontroller.setAppearanceLightNavigationBars(is_light_system_bars)\r\n\t\t\tcontroller.setAppearanceLightStatusBars(is_light_system_bars)\r\n\t\r\n\tactivity.runOnUiThread(android_runtime.createRunnableFromGodotCallable(callable))\r\n```\r\n</details> \r\n\r\nUpdate: It's not trivial to do this via JavaClassWrapper. See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109667","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","r